<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>SlintPlot apps: third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 860px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 16px; color: #1d2433; background: #fff; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f5f6f8; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>The SlintPlot gallery and stress apps are built from these open-source crates.
SlintPlot itself is licensed as described in LICENSE.md.</p>
<h2>Slint</h2>
<p>The apps are built with <a href="https://slint.dev">Slint</a> (the <code>slint</code> and <code>i-slint-*</code> crates),
used under the Slint Royalty-free License 2.0, included as LICENSE-SLINT.md.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
